### Create a new physical trainer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 1,
  "firstName": "Fernando",
  "lastName": "Signorini",
  "documentNumber": "33444555",
  "age": 60,
  "dateOfBirth": "1965-03-12",
  "photoUrl": "https://storage.example.com/photos/fernando-signorini.jpg"
}

### Create a physical trainer without photo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 1,
  "firstName": "Luis",
  "lastName": "Martín",
  "documentNumber": "44555666",
  "age": 42,
  "dateOfBirth": "1983-07-22"
}

### Get all physical trainers for a club (replace with actual club ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers?clubId=1

### Get physical trainer by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers/1

### Update a physical trainer (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Fernando",
  "lastName": "Signorini",
  "documentNumber": "33444555",
  "age": 61,
  "dateOfBirth": "1965-03-12",
  "photoUrl": "https://storage.example.com/photos/fernando-signorini-updated.jpg"
}

### Delete a physical trainer (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/physical-trainers/1
